        "id": "observation-14",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Depression and anxiety screening"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Informal assessment: depressive symptoms present but mild, with function preserved; anxiety is highly situational and related to blood-injection-injury phobia. Formal PHQ-9 and GAD-7 deferred."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-15",
