          "text": "Work functioning"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Continues working as an administrative assistant; staff vaccination clinics and pathology pickups are very stressful because of needles, and she sometimes swaps tasks."
      }
    },
